<title>AUSTRALIA: Country Road says plans no announcement.</title>
<headline>Country Road says plans no announcement.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clothing retailer Country Road Ltd said on Wednesday it was not planning to make any announcement to the stock exchange and was unaware of why its price had surged on hefty turnover late on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Market speculation of a takeover followed the purchase of about 15 percent of Country Road's shares at A$2.00, about 30 cents above the going market rate immediately before the big trades.</p>
</text>
